            type: "Euro Plum",
            name: "Early Blue",
            category: "European plum varieties recommended for northern New Mexico",
            description: "European plums (the blue/purple ones in general; Figure 1) flower later than Japanese types and more frequently escape frost injury. They are recommended for northern New Mexico and high elevations. Recommended varieties are 'Early Blue', 'Castleton', and 'Stanley'. In general, their performance has been poor in southern New Mexico."
